<title>USA: Syntellect shares privately placed.</title>
<headline>Syntellect shares privately placed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment bankers Kaufman Bros LP said Thursday it has placed a block of 1.15 million shares of unregistered, restricted stock of Syntellect Inc in a private transaction with two buyers, MKGVD Fund and E&amp;M RP Trust.</p>
<p>The block represents 8.6 percent of the outstanding shares of Syntellect, Kaufman said.</p>
</text>
